  "prefLabel": "Ph 301.04 Required Examination Score",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-04-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 301.04 Required Examination Score. To successfully complete the NAPLEX and NH MPJE examinations required by Ph 301.03, the candidate shall, on the initial examination or any subsequent re-examination permitted by Ph 301.05, obtain a score of not less than 75 on each examination.\n\nSource. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96; amd by #6933, eff 2-1-99; paragraph (a) and subparagraphs (b)(1) and (b)(3) EXPIRED: 2-5-04; amd by #8316, eff 3-26-05; paragraph (b) and subparagraphs (b)(2) and (b)(4) EXPIRED: 2-1-07; paragraph (a) and subparagraphs (b)(1) and (b)(3) EXPIRED: 3-26-13\n\nNew. #10702, INTERIM, eff 10-23-14, EXPIRED: 4-21-15\n\nNew. #11031, eff 1-29-16 (from Ph 301.05)",
